<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-010-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) regeneration as a lawful growth process — Durbin/Ellis tadpole tail curves — Model fidelity to source: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Every law Thompson states (E1-E7) is implemented as written, now including the generalised power decay with free exponent and the asymptotic isochrone family; the Lean module kernel-checks E1, E2, E3, E5, E6, E7 with 0 sorry. Remaining gap: Thompson's 'latent period' before day 3 is a fitted t0, not modelled." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
